      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/nov/16/us-bank-outage-chase-wells-fargo",
      "description": "<p>Bank of America, Chase, US Bank, Wells Fargo and Truist were listed by users who have been experiencing issues</p><p>Customers reported difficulty accessing their online accounts at some major US banks on Monday.</p><p>The reports follow a major outage by Microsoft that began Friday and lasted for hours, which affected services including Outlook, Teams and AI assistant Copilot and had serious repercussions all around the world. Also on Friday, ageing equipment led to a temporary grounding of all commercial airplanes in the US, sparking travel havoc.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/nov/16/us-bank-outage-chase-wells-fargo\">Continue reading...</a>",
